    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two cases with prepositions",
     "texto": [
      "**Na** with a fixed place usually takes the locative: **na biurku**, «on the desk». **Pod** and **nad** usually take the instrumental: **pod stołem** («under the table»), **nad stołem** («above the table»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Furniture and position",
     "texto": [
      "The verbs **leży** («is lying/leaning»), **stoi** («is standing») and **wisi** («is hanging») describe how an object is placed."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
